    "id": "proxy-terminal-personal",
    "key": "personal",
    "name": "About, friends & social screens",
    "blurb": "Editable personal bio, creator notes, open friend slots and a Discord link. Empty slots are intentionally non-clickable until configured.",
    "css": ".zz-personal { position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 44px; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 0%, #455a2229, transparent 55%), repeating-linear-gradient(125deg, transparent 0 49px, #46543312 50px 51px), #11150f; }\n.zz-personal::before { content: \"INTER-KNOT\"; position: absolute; top: 20px; right: -30px; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; font-size: 95px; font-weight: 1000; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -.08em; color: #d7f22a08; transform: rotate(-8deg); }\n.zz-eyebrow { position: relative; color: #d7f22a; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.zz-personal h2 { position: relative; margin: 14px 0 30px; color: #f0f3e2; font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 76px); font-weight: 1000; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -.07em; line-height: .92; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.zz-personal h2 em { color: #d7f22a; }\n.zz-personal h3 { color: #e5ecd9; font-size: 17px; font-style: italic; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.zz-personal p { color: #b3bea3; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; }\n.zz-about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(220px, 1fr); gap: 28px; }\n.zz-bio-card { position: relative; padding: 27px; border: 1px solid #485239; border-top: 5px solid #d7f22a; border-radius: 7px; background: #1c2317; }\n.zz-bio-card p + p { margin-top: 17px; }\n.zz-bio-card .zz-big-copy { color: #e2e9d5; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.35; letter-spacing: -.035em; font-weight: 700; }\n.zz-note { margin-top: 25px !important; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid #414d31; font-size: 11px !important; }\n.zz-log { padding: 19px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #3b462d; }\n.zz-log:first-child { padding-top: 0; }\n.zz-log summary { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; color: #dce7c8; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.zz-log summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n.zz-log summary::after { content: \"+\"; color: #d7f22a; }\n.zz-log[open] summary::after { content: \"−\"; }\n.zz-log p { padding-top: 13px; font-size: 12px; }\n.zz-friend-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 25px; }\n.zz-friend { position: relative; min-height: 195px; padding: 23px; border: 1px dashed #607143; border-radius: 9px; background: #1a2214; }\n.zz-friend > span { display: flex; width: 50px; height: 50px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 21px; border: 1px solid #667846; border-radius: 50%; color: #d7f22a; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 300; }\n.zz-friend h3 { margin-bottom: 7px; }\n.zz-friend p { font-size: 11px; }\n.zz-friend-link { display: block; color: inherit; }\n.zz-friend-link:hover { border-color: #d7f22a; background: #25351a; }\n.zz-social-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(210px, 1fr); gap: 18px; margin-top: 26px; }\n.zz-social { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; min-height: 182px; padding: 25px; border: 1px solid #5c7040; border-radius: 8px; background: #202c18; }\n.zz-social small { color: #c1d1a9; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .18em; font-weight: 900; }\n.zz-social strong { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; color: #eef3dc; font-size: 31px; font-weight: 1000; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -.05em; }\n.zz-social b { color: #d7f22a; font-style: normal; }\n.zz-social:hover { border-color: #d7f22a; background: #2d3c20; }\n.zz-social-empty { border-style: dashed; background: #151c11; }\n.zz-social-empty strong { font-size: 22px; color: #96a682; }\n.zz-personal .zz-bottom-note { margin-top: 26px; color: #83956b; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .06em; }\n@media (max-width: 800px) { .zz-personal { padding: 30px 23px; } .zz-about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 23px; } .zz-friend-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .zz-friend { min-height: 135px; } .zz-friend > span { float: left; margin: 0 20px 20px 0; } .zz-social-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .zz-personal::before { font-size: 65px; } .zz-bio-card { padding: 22px; } }\n",
    "html": "<section class=\"zz-screen zz-personal zz-about-screen\" aria-label=\"About me\"><span class=\"zz-eyebrow\">02 / Personal file</span><h2>Behind the <em>screen.</em></h2><div class=\"zz-about-grid\"><article class=\"zz-bio-card\"><p class=\"zz-big-copy\">A little introduction goes a long way.</p><p>This is your corner of the terminal. Add who you are, the worlds you like writing, and what people can expect from your characters.</p><p>Keep it casual. Make it yours.</p><p class=\"zz-note\">Edit this bio in your About Me code. The menu takes care of the rest.</p></article><div><details class=\"zz-log\" open><summary>Creator notes</summary><p>Room for your current projects, release notes, and the things you want visitors to know before they jump into a chat.</p></details><details class=\"zz-log\"><summary>Before you connect</summary><p>Add your boundaries, content notes, or roleplay preferences here.</p></details><details class=\"zz-log\"><summary>Current transmission</summary><p>A place for your latest update, next character teaser, or a note to your regulars.</p></details></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"zz-screen zz-personal zz-friends-screen\" aria-label=\"Friends\"><span class=\"zz-eyebrow\">03 / Your people</span><h2>The <em>inner circle.</em></h2><p>Good stories. Better company. A space for your friends and favorite creators.</p><div class=\"zz-friend-grid\"><article class=\"zz-friend\"><span>+</span><h3>Open channel / 01</h3><p>A spot for a friend.<br>Add their name, profile link and a little introduction.</p></article><article class=\"zz-friend\"><span>+</span><h3>Open channel / 02</h3><p>A spot for a creator you love.<br>Give visitors someone new to discover.</p></article><article class=\"zz-friend\"><span>+</span><h3>Open channel / 03</h3><p>Keep your circle growing.<br>This channel is ready when you are.</p></article></div><p class=\"zz-bottom-note\">Friend slots are left open for you to customize.</p></section>\n<section class=\"zz-screen zz-personal zz-links-screen\" aria-label=\"Social links\"><span class=\"zz-eyebrow\">04 / Outside the terminal</span><h2>Stay <em>connected.</em></h2><p>Another channel. The same creator.</p><div class=\"zz-social-list\"><a class=\"zz-social\" href=\"https://discord.gg/e2HDbWXUBp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><small>COMMUNITY / INVITE</small><strong>Discord <b>↗</b></strong></a><div class=\"zz-social zz-social-empty\"><small>YOUR NEXT CHANNEL</small><strong>Space for your socials <b>+</b></strong><p>Add your website, art page, or another social profile.</p></div></div><p class=\"zz-bottom-note\">Add more links by duplicating a social card in the markup.</p></section>\n<div class=\"zz-footer\"><span>PROXY TERMINAL / SWEEPERCOM</span><span>Choose a file. Enter a story. <a href=\"#zz-agents\">↖ Back to agents</a></span></div>\n",
